data: {"id": "104cad408b494b15-thinking-parallel_evidence-241", "run_id": "104cad408b494b15", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 执行计划\n\n我将并行执行以下关键验证：\n1. `kubectl_describe pod workload -n aiops-case-v01` - 获取 Pod 状态和 FailedScheduling 事件\n2. `kubectl_get_yaml pod workload -n aiops-case-v01` - 获取资源需求和调度约束配置\n3. `kubectl_events pod workload -n aiops-case-v01` - 获取调度事件\n4. `kubectl get nodes -o wide` - 获取集群节点状态\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789106850693, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

