event: thinking
data: {"id": "104cad408b494b15-thinking-parallel_evidence-841", "run_id": "104cad408b494b15", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 事实证据\n\n- **Pod 状态**: `phase=Pending`, `nodeName=none`, `conditions[PodScheduled]=False`。与 PromQL 结果一致：`kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"}=1`。\n- **容器配置**: 容器 `app`，镜像 `python:3-alpine`。Requests: `memory=8Mi`（无 CPU requests）。Limits: `cpu=100k`, `memory=32Mi`。\n- **调度约束**: `Node-Selectors: <none>`, `Tolerations` 仅有 `not-ready:NoExecute`。无亲和性/反亲和性、无 PVC。\n- **FailedScheduling 事件（3条，最近 39m 起持续触发）**: `0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu. preemption: 3 No preemption victims found`。全部原因一致：**", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789106859957, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "104cad408b494b15-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "104cad408b494b15", "seq": 842, "ts_ms": 1789106867615, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 33.902, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v01", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/104cad408b494b15-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "70fc2c96ffcd844fa474bdcc9d2e233b269340c7679ab6d4108b1ea632c611b8", "bytes": 2419}, "snapshot_sha256": "88df214eccf0f7f78d29367f97b096d01750a1155ed27a224523bd595ea04a6b"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "104cad408b494b15-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "104cad408b494b15", "seq": 843, "ts_ms": 1789106867616, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "104cad408b494b15-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "104cad408b494b15", "seq": 844, "ts_ms": 1789106875349, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 7.733, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1322, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v01/workload` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-v01/workload 处于 Pending 状态，持续报 FailedScheduling |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | pod.condition (fact-7915f3ab13d6) | PodScheduled=False; reason=Unschedulable; message=\"0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu\" | 确认 Pod 处于不可调度状态，直接原因是 CPU 不足 |\n| 2 | K8s State | pod.phase (fact-4988fcae3dd0) | phase=Pending | 确认 Pod 持续停留在 Pending 状态 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | event.message (fact-5279f4c698f3) | Warning FailedScheduling 8m54s (x6 over 33m) 3 Insufficient cpu. No preemption victims found | 证实调度器在过去 33 分钟内反复尝试失败，且无法通过抢占解决 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | container.resource_request.cpu (fact-164b1041f1db) | value=100k (container: app) | 确认该 Pod 请求 0.1 CPU 资源，但集群节点无余量可满足 |\n\n**证据总结：**\nK8s 事件与状态事实互相印证：Pod 因 Insufficient cpu 被调度器拒绝，且所有 3 个节点均无预emption 对象。日志与链路追踪未采集到数据，符合 Pod 未启动的物理状态，无冲突证据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n集群节点可分配 CPU 资源耗尽 → Pod cpu=100k 请求无法满足且无抢占对象 → 调度器返回 Unschedulable → Pod 保持 Pending 并触发 FailedScheduling\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**集群可用 CPU 资源枯竭**。\n证据编号 [1, 2, 3] 显示 3/3 节点均报告 \"Insufficient cpu\"，且缺乏可抢占的 Pod（\"No preemption victims found\"），导致调度器无法将 `aiops-case-v01/workload` 放置在任何节点上。\n**未知点**：当前证据未能识别具体是哪个工作负载占满了这 3 个节点的可分配 CPU 资源。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v01/workload` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-v01/workload 处于 Pending 状态，持续报 FailedScheduling |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | pod.condition (fact-7915f3ab13d6) | PodScheduled=False; reason=Unschedulable; message=\"0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu\" | 确认 Pod 处于不可调度状态，直接原因是 CPU 不足 |\n| 2 | K8s State | pod.phase (fact-4988fcae3dd0) | phase=Pending | 确认 Pod 持续停留在 Pending 状态 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | event.message (fact-5279f4c698f3) | Warning FailedScheduling 8m54s (x6 over 33m) 3 Insufficient cpu. No preemption victims found | 证实调度器在过去 33 分钟内反复尝试失败，且无法通过抢占解决 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | container.resource_request.cpu (fact-164b1041f1db) | value=100k (container: app) | 确认该 Pod 请求 0.1 CPU 资源，但集群节点无余量可满足 |\n\n**证据总结：**\nK8s 事件与状态事实互相印证：Pod 因 Insufficient cpu 被调度器拒绝，且所有 3 个节点均无预emption 对象。日志与链路追踪未采集到数据，符合 Pod 未启动的物理状态，无冲突证据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n集群节点可分配 CPU 资源耗尽 → Pod cpu=100k 请求无法满足且无抢占对象 → 调度器返回 Unschedulable → Pod 保持 Pending 并触发 FailedScheduling\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**集群可用 CPU 资源枯竭**。\n证据编号 [1, 2, 3] 显示 3/3 节点均报告 \"Insufficient cpu\"，且缺乏可抢占的 Pod（\"No preemption victims found\"），导致调度器无法将 `aiops-case-v01/workload` 放置在任何节点上。\n**未知点**：当前证据未能识别具体是哪个工作负载占满了这 3 个节点的可分配 CPU 资源。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

